@backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5212
@authToken = your_jwt_token_here

### 1. Health Check
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Swagger Specification
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json
Accept: application/json

### 3. User Authentication — Login (Admin)
# @name login
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@iec.app",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 4. User Authentication — Login (Technician)
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "tech@iec.app",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 5. Assets — List Assets (Paginated)
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/assets?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. Evidence — List Evidence (Paginated)
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/evidence?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 7. Evidence — Get Evidence by ID
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/evidence/c73a8840-3b95-46b7-8798-1e43b1234567
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 8. Admin — List Users Pending Approval
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/admin/users/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json
